.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
site.auto.tfvars
# Committed on purpose, despite the repository-wide patterns: the lock file pins the verified provider hashes
# (ADR 0013), and the desktop list holds no secrets. site.auto.tfvars (real addresses) stays ignored.
!.terraform.lock.hcl
!desktops.auto.tfvars
